OL,3,AIsraeli air strike kills Hamas internal
OL,4,Asecurity chief in Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least seven Palestinians, including
OL,7,Fa senior Hamas security official, have
OL,8,Fbeen killed in Israeli air strikes in
OL,9,Fthe Gaza Strip, health officials and
OL,10,Ffirst responders say.
OL,12,FNaeem Abu Nahel, the head of Hamas's
OL,13,Finternal security service, was targeted
OL,14,Fin western Gaza City, Gaza's Hamas-run
OL,15,Finterior ministry said. The 50-year-old
OL,16,Fhad only been in the position since
OL,17,FSeptember, when his predecessor was
OL,18,Fcaptured in a raid by Israeli special
OL,19,Fforces.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
