OL,3,AIsraeli air strike kills Hamas internal
OL,4,Asecurity chief in Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,7,FNetanyahu and Defence Minister Israel
OL,8,FKatz announced that Abu Nahel was
OL,9,F"eliminated" by the Israeli military.
OL,11,FThe six other people were killed in two
OL,12,Fearlier air strikes elsewhere in Gaza.
